asgard-printing-extras (1.0.0) thor; urgency=low

  * Initial @DISTRIBUTION@ printing + scanning metapackage.  Adds
    cups (print server) + cups-pk-helper (PolicyKit shim for the
    GNOME printer dialog) + simple-scan (scanner UI) on top of the
    system-config-printer-* shipped by asgard-gnome-desktop.
    Depends on asgard-gnome-desktop.

